cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Quarkonium-System: heavy-quarkonium spectroscopy with the Gaussian Expansion Method"
abstract: >-
  Charmonium, bottomonium and B_c spectra from non-relativistic and
  relativized (Godfrey-Isgur) potential models, solved with the Gaussian
  Expansion Method and fitted to the PDG, with a statistical analysis of the
  models: information criteria, cross-validation, bootstrap, MCMC and model
  averaging.
authors:
